This repository is no longer used.

The Brute Force Stop package (plugin and component in one Joomla!
installation package) is now built in the plugin's repository, from the
release tags of plugin and component, by CI:

    https://github.com/codeling/bfstop/tree/main/package

Releases (with the package zip) are published at
https://github.com/codeling/bfstop/releases

Problems should be reported in the issue tracker of the bfstop extension:
https://github.com/codeling/bfstop/issues
